2. WHAT THIS LICENCE IS FOR

   The point of it is to be evidence. The binary carries the copyright and these
   terms internally, so an artifact found in someone else's hands states what it
   was and on what basis. That is what a dispute or a takedown turns on.

   It is not an attempt to make the software unreadable. Anyone holding a copy can
   read it; see IMPLEMENTATION.md and TODO.md for what is and is not technically
   recoverable from the shipped binary, measured rather than assumed.

